Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:02.70,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,De ce nu sunt suprins?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:02.70,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Oh, da, nu astăzi ar trebui să vină colega cea nouă?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:02.70,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Ce? E prima oară când aud asta
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:02.70,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,E foarte drăguță
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:02.70,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Pare să fie genul meu
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:02.70,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Tu ce părere ai, Shunichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:02.70,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Mi se pare o fată normală
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:02.70,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,O voi invita să ia prânzul cu noooiiii
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:02.70,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Nu sunt interesat
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:02.70,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Nu sunt interesat
