Dialogue: 99,0:00:17.04,0:00:19.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My family has always been awkward.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:19.75,0:00:20.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuu!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:21.42,0:00:23.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today is an important day for your sister!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.92,0:00:24.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuu—
Dialogue: 99,0:00:24.42,0:00:25.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for breakfast.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:25.84,0:00:27.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Finished already?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:27.22,0:00:29.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I've gotta get going.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.55,0:00:32.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You always make the best tea, Mom.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:35.43,0:00:37.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They've never known how to act around me.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.18,0:00:41.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My mother always struggles to make eye contact at important times like this.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:41.90,0:00:42.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hana...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.28,0:00:47.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do your best. But for {\i1}you{\i0}, got it?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:48.28,0:00:52.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dad always scratches the top of his nose when he lies.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:52.16,0:00:54.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, the same as ever.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:55.74,0:00:56.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:58.04,0:01:00.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And my brother Yuuto...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:00.87,0:01:02.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}still hasn't learned to lie yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:04.54,0:01:07.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, now you've met my family.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:07.09,0:01:09.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're an awkward bunch.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:11.55,0:01:13.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I really want...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:13.43,0:01:15.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to protect them.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:25.15,0:01:30.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This morning reminded me of when I passed my school entrance exams.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:30.99,0:01:35.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mom and Dad were even more nervous than I was.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:39.83,0:01:42.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We live in such a cruel world...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:42.50,0:01:45.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One where some are chosen,\Nwhile others are not.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:45.88,0:01:50.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One where some are lucky,\Nwhile others are unlucky.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.72,0:01:52.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Analysis is in. It's {\i1}black{\i0}.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:52.30,0:01:55.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a shame. He's handsome.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.09,0:01:58.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And it doesn't take much to push you to one side or the other.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.10,0:02:01.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:03.52,0:02:04.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hit.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:05.61,0:02:08.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The other one's results should be in today, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:08.15,0:02:10.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is her first, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.11,0:02:12.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope it's {\i1}white{\i0}.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.07,0:02:17.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And even though I'm on the "chosen" side,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:17.16,0:02:21.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've never considered myself to be lucky.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:23.08,0:02:25.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will today be the day we finally find the {\i0}one{\i1}?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.17,0:02:28.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The one we've been searching for all this time:
Dialogue: 99,0:02:29.46,0:02:31.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}our last hope.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:38.30,0:02:40.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miss Tougetsu, are you all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:40.60,0:02:41.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:41.77,0:02:42.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be right out.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:43.14,0:02:45.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be nervous about.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:45.35,0:02:46.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll get along just fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:54.90,0:02:56.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Tougetsu Hana.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:56.78,0:02:58.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you all.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:59.03,0:03:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her father's job requires her family to move a lot
Dialogue: 99,0:03:03.87,0:03:07.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,which is why she's transferring in so late in the year.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.63,0:03:09.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Try to make her feel at home, okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:09.46,0:03:11.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:15.80,0:03:17.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Traffic at this hour?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.14,0:03:18.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just my luck.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.81,0:03:26.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hana, Hana!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.02,0:03:27.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.90,0:03:29.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,want to eat lunch with us?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:29.27,0:03:30.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on! Scram!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.36,0:03:32.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No boys allowed!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:32.15,0:03:34.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? You girls jealous or something?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:33.82,0:03:34.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say what!?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.99,0:03:36.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be an idiot!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:36.36,0:03:38.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't usually get transfers at this time of year.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.74,0:03:40.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that your old school uniform?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:40.99,0:03:43.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's such a thing as being {\i1}too{\i0} curious.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:43.37,0:03:44.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.83,0:03:45.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd say...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:45.25,0:03:45.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:46.50,0:03:48.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something big going on.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:48.37,0:03:49.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:49.79,0:03:52.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They've shut down all the roads to the island.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:52.42,0:03:54.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would they do that?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:57.09,0:03:59.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please wait here.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:05.48,0:04:07.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-6, this is 0-0.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:08.39,0:04:09.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:09.65,0:04:11.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got bad news.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:11.31,0:04:15.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In a few minutes, your location is going to be raided.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:14.36,0:04:16.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's getting exciting!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:15.19,0:04:17.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It took us too long to break through their encryption.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:17.86,0:04:18.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There isn't much time.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:19.11,0:04:20.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The analysis isn't finished yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:20.49,0:04:23.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You need to leave with the target immediately.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:23.16,0:04:25.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Report back as soon as you are both safe.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:25.50,0:04:26.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-0, out.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:28.54,0:04:31.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Everyone online is saying there are choppers everywhere. See!?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:30.42,0:04:32.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tougetsu...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:33.46,0:04:34.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tougetsu?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:37.76,0:04:39.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:41.22,0:04:43.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:43.22,0:04:43.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:47.39,0:04:48.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.73,0:04:49.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:52.90,0:04:54.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:55.40,0:04:57.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that for?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.44,0:04:59.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You need to stay close to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:59.24,0:04:59.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:00.74,0:05:02.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:02.45,0:05:03.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you'll die.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:04.91,0:05:06.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.07,0:05:41.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:42.16,0:05:43.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:24.20,0:06:25.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clear!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:25.24,0:06:26.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clear!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:26.78,0:06:28.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tango down! We'll bring him out.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:31.91,0:06:33.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:33.41,0:06:35.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-0, this is 0-6.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:35.33,0:06:37.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've secured the target.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.00,0:06:38.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we're trapped inside—
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.96,0:06:38.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-6!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:39.21,0:06:41.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've figured out the enemy's objective.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:41.88,0:06:44.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're after an escaped research subject, "P."
Dialogue: 99,0:06:44.59,0:06:46.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once they've found P, \Nthey'll open the panic doors.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.93,0:06:50.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rejoin the other students \Nand evacuate with the target.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:50.68,0:06:52.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take route {\i1}Bravo{\i0}.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:52.23,0:06:54.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At extraction point {\i1}Echo{\i0}, \Na helicopter will pick you up.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:54.69,0:06:57.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? \NWe don't know his color yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:57.94,0:06:59.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We just got the results.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:59.86,0:07:01.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's {\i1}white{\i0}.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:01.40,0:07:02.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Return with the target.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:02.57,0:07:03.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:03.70,0:07:05.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you muttering abou—
Dialogue: 99,0:07:06.61,0:07:08.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:08.07,0:07:09.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.49,0:07:14.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may be our last hope.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:15.00,0:07:15.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:19.29,0:07:20.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel Amagata...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:20.63,0:07:23.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're picking up more of the US's communications.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:23.30,0:07:24.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seems something went wrong.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:24.76,0:07:28.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Communications back to their HQ have become erratic, almost panicked.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:40.40,0:07:41.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:41.15,0:07:42.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-0, this is 0-6.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.82,0:07:44.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:44.11,0:07:45.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-6, this is 0-0.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.86,0:07:46.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got a situation.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:47.57,0:07:50.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The research subject, P, has pandoralized.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:50.12,0:07:52.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The US forces are evacuating the students now.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.37,0:07:54.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then they'll... the Pandora...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.87,0:07:58.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...now... I repeat...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:58.21,0:08:00.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-0, negative copy!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:00.63,0:08:02.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say again!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.05,0:08:03.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:03.17,0:08:05.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel Amagata!?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.63,0:08:09.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Students, please cooperate with school staff and military personnel
Dialogue: 99,0:08:09.22,0:08:11.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and gather at the practice field.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.39,0:08:13.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've lost contact with 0-6.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:13.47,0:08:15.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,ECMs! They're blocking our signal!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:15.02,0:08:18.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The surveillance satellites are affected as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:18.27,0:08:19.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's 0-3's status?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:20.06,0:08:21.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On her way back now, Sir.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:21.69,0:08:23.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get her ready to redeploy.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:23.61,0:08:25.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It hasn't been twelve hours!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.07,0:08:26.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And she's injured from her last mission.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:26.95,0:08:30.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We risk increased pandoralization if we put her under too much genomic stress.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:32.24,0:08:33.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pandora...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:34.12,0:08:37.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The "light of humanity"... or so we thought.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:42.04,0:08:44.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone keep calm and wait to board!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.50,0:08:46.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă mulțumim pentru înțelegere!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:49.84,0:08:51.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no good. There's no signal.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:57.14,0:08:58.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not!?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.56,0:09:00.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We should evacuate with everyone else!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:00.90,0:09:02.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't do that...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:02.48,0:09:03.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.11,0:09:06.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because they're looking for you, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.65,0:09:07.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:07.32,0:09:08.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:12.24,0:09:15.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Command, this is India 2-5. \NFound a couple of students left behind.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:16.87,0:09:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you show us your IDs please?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:15.99,0:09:19.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.29,0:09:22.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, here.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:23.79,0:09:25.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:25.00,0:09:26.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you Miss?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:29.42,0:09:30.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the—
Dialogue: 99,0:09:44.06,0:09:46.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're... Flowers...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:52.91,0:09:53.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:08.67,0:10:11.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, you have to come with me.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.26,0:10:14.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:15.30,0:10:17.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are all students accounted for?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:17.26,0:10:19.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No sir, two students are unaccounted for.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.52,0:10:22.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? This boy is...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:22.73,0:10:26.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is India 6-4. India 2-5 is down!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:26.19,0:10:27.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got Flowers!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:27.36,0:10:28.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Flowers!?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:28.32,0:10:29.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't know which one.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:29.48,0:10:31.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We need reinforcements!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:31.03,0:10:32.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Goddamn Underdogs!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:32.57,0:10:34.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell are they doing here?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:34.53,0:10:37.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If one of the two is with Flowers, the other must be...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:38.70,0:10:40.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We need immediate CAS!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:40.29,0:10:43.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take out the hostile and secure the other! I want the kid alive!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:18.87,0:11:20.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the f—
Dialogue: 99,0:11:35.26,0:11:38.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell is that monster?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:38.47,0:11:39.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Pandora.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:45.69,0:11:47.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:59.78,0:12:01.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:01.74,0:12:04.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can you eat after {\i1}that{\i}?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:04.04,0:12:06.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but can we get some more cake?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:07.79,0:12:09.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, that is {\i1}precisely{\i0} why I need cake.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:18.26,0:12:19.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-2, roger.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:19.93,0:12:21.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-8, copy.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:22.93,0:12:24.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shall we go?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:25.14,0:12:27.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An active operation in a highschool?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:27.69,0:12:31.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They've sealed off the area\Nwith the help of local police.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:31.48,0:12:35.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the task force they stationed \Nin Japan half a year ago.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:35.36,0:12:39.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We believe they are after \Nan escaped research subject, P.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:39.91,0:12:41.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:41.49,0:12:44.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are also hearing that a Flower is on-site.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:45.50,0:12:49.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave the kids out of this, Amagata.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:51.83,0:12:54.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For a military exercise, \Nthey're really going all out.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:54.46,0:12:57.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are dangerous times.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:57.09,0:12:59.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,X-ray 6-4 to command. Report in, over.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:59.43,0:13:02.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Command to X-ray 6-4. The Pandora has not moved yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.51,0:13:05.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,X-ray 3-2 and X-ray 4-2 are in visual contact.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:05.77,0:13:08.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Copy. Maintain visual contact until further notice.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:16.11,0:13:17.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:17.57,0:13:18.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:20.57,0:13:23.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm all... right.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:23.45,0:13:24.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clearly you're not!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:37.26,0:13:39.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you look the other way?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:39.05,0:13:40.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.23,0:13:56.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can look now.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:58.48,0:14:01.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've taken some medicine. \NI should be stabilized for now.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:02.11,0:14:04.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:05.41,0:14:07.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I introduced myself just this morning.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:10.16,0:14:11.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tougetsu.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:11.62,0:14:13.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tougetsu Hana.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:13.29,0:14:15.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hana, is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:15.63,0:14:16.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Nanase...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:16.96,0:14:18.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shunichi, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:19.63,0:14:20.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:21.59,0:14:24.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've known it for a long time.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:24.01,0:14:26.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since long before today.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.10,0:14:37.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All clear. Let's move out.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:47.41,0:14:48.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:48.95,0:14:50.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,about what you said before...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:50.29,0:14:53.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that I'm your hope or whatever.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:53.16,0:14:55.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you mean by that?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:56.13,0:14:59.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's an assassination unit called "Flowers."
Dialogue: 99,0:14:59.05,0:15:00.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Assassination?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:01.67,0:15:04.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a reference to the way \Nflowers die and the petals fall off.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:04.72,0:15:06.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A horrible name when you think about it.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:07.47,0:15:10.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm one of them—a Flower.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:11.02,0:15:12.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shunichi...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:12.68,0:15:15.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are your parents?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:16.35,0:15:17.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:18.31,0:15:21.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you love your parents?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:22.78,0:15:24.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't really know.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:25.03,0:15:29.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One day when I was little, \Nmy dad didn't come home.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.58,0:15:31.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He just disappeared.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.87,0:15:34.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My mom said,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:34.08,0:15:37.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Your dad is working on something very important for you."
Dialogue: 99,0:15:37.71,0:15:39.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She always defended him.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:39.46,0:15:43.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I would have preferred if she'd just told me he ran off with another woman.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.80,0:15:46.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You never know...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:46.72,0:15:50.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He might really be working hard... for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:50.18,0:15:51.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I doubt it...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:51.56,0:15:55.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not doing this because I want to.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:55.10,0:15:55.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:55.89,0:15:57.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like back there in the stairway...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:57.44,0:15:59.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to kill him.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:59.65,0:16:01.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if I disobey my orders,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:01.44,0:16:04.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,my mom and dad will be...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:02.32,0:16:03.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:07.28,0:16:09.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our fate rests...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:09.70,0:16:12.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in the hands of a sixteen-year-old boy.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:12.24,0:16:14.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The older members always used to say,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:14.33,0:16:16.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"He's our only hope" before they all died.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:16.83,0:16:17.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean me?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.75,0:16:20.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shunichi,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:20.42,0:16:23.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you may be the only one who can free us from...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:23.00,0:16:24.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,this curse.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:32.85,0:16:34.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This girl is really...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:34.77,0:16:36.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,an assassin?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.45,0:16:51.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:53.54,0:16:55.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You already secured the package?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:55.25,0:16:58.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Prince 6-3, make sure the humvees get moved out.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:55.79,0:16:57.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about the Flower?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:57.00,0:16:58.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't know, sir.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.79,0:16:59.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.75,0:17:03.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take the package to the rooftop while the Pandora is still inactive.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:03.21,0:17:04.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get on the heli and leave.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:04.92,0:17:08.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As soon as the heli takes off, destroy the hostiles and the building.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:22.73,0:17:25.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told him to stay close...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:29.24,0:17:31.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-2 and 0-8 in position.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:31.87,0:17:33.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's 0-3?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:33.28,0:17:37.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They had to take a detour to avoid detection. \NApproaching point D-2 now.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:49.84,0:17:51.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tougetsu!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:52.89,0:17:55.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Engaged with the Flower! We need fire support!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:10.28,0:18:12.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There she is! Open fire!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:12.16,0:18:13.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's wounded!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:13.28,0:18:14.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Great! Shoot her anyway!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:16.08,0:18:17.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shit! We're hit!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:17.16,0:18:18.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where'd that come from?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:49.78,0:18:50.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:52.70,0:18:53.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go out the back gate.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.78,0:18:56.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a tower 500 meters to the west.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:56.49,0:18:57.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait for me there!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:59.62,0:19:00.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:00.87,0:19:03.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you so desperate to...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:03.08,0:19:05.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you already.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:05.00,0:19:08.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You might be our only hope.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:12.55,0:19:13.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:13.51,0:19:14.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:14.47,0:19:15.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:29.61,0:19:30.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't die.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:30.65,0:19:32.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:35.61,0:19:37.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm going to go home...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.99,0:19:43.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to tell Mom, Dad, and Yuu that everything is going to be okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:46.42,0:19:48.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And they'll welcome me home!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:59.30,0:20:00.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:11.52,0:20:12.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hana...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:13.74,0:20:15.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire the TOW now!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:15.20,0:20:16.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's danger close!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.95,0:20:18.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just do it, goddammit!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:51.73,0:20:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tougetsu!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:53.61,0:20:54.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:54.53,0:20:56.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tougetsu!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:56.19,0:20:57.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tougetsu!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:39.61,0:21:41.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jesus, what was that!?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:46.20,0:21:49.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To all units, it's Flower number 0-3!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:49.04,0:21:50.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:50.71,0:21:52.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Avoid contact and bug out!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:52.79,0:21:55.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Request USS Mandible to launch their cruise missile!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:55.71,0:21:57.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll evac now!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:57.38,0:21:58.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:02.59,0:22:04.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:04.30,0:22:05.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll have to—
Dialogue: 99,0:22:20.20,0:22:23.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can still... do this.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:23.32,0:22:24.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:31.41,0:22:33.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anthea...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:33.54,0:22:36.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can... keep... going.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:36.21,0:22:37.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:44.26,0:22:46.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anthea!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:46.30,0:22:49.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care of Shunichi.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:49.52,0:22:52.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,P-Please save everyone...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:56.77,0:22:58.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:58.36,0:23:00.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You always get the dirty jobs.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:07.70,0:23:09.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:14.00,0:23:16.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It should clear up by this evening.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:16.17,0:23:18.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can see the sun peeking through there.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:18.34,0:23:19.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:23.97,0:23:25.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've suffered enough...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:26.59,0:23:27.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:42.32,0:23:43.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:43.78,0:23:45.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:45.61,0:23:46.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:51.08,0:23:52.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look over there!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:31.95,0:24:35.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-3, this is 0-0. We're back on.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:35.00,0:24:38.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tomahawk was launched from \Nthe bay to the mission area.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:38.21,0:24:39.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Evacuate immediately.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:39.83,0:24:41.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-0, this is 0-3.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:41.75,0:24:43.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've obtained 0-6's data.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:43.50,0:24:45.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Requesting permission to continue 0-6's mission.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:46.88,0:24:48.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Approved.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:27.13,0:27:28.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:38.22,0:27:39.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hana...
Dialogue: 99,0:27:40.14,0:27:41.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were wrong again.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:45.73,0:27:46.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:46.86,0:27:48.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We thought it was {\i1}white{\i0} at first.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:48.82,0:27:50.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then we noticed some signs of pandoralization.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:50.94,0:27:52.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So we changed our diagnosis to {\i1}black{\i0}.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:52.57,0:27:55.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We had the Flower eliminate it.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:55.11,0:27:57.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've never seen a case like this before.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:57.45,0:27:59.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More in-depth analysis will be required.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:00.33,0:28:01.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll report what we find.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:04.29,0:28:08.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our mission is to kill the light of humanity.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:10.67,0:28:14.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our families and friends are taken as hostages.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:14.67,0:28:20.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Neither failure, escape, nor even death can release us.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:22.18,0:28:26.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our mission is to destroy our own hope.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:28.98,0:28:31.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Still, there is hope."
Dialogue: 99,0:28:31.48,0:28:32.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.25,0:07:20.63,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,

